templateVersions.content:
A government notice was amended. Explain the change to a capture team in at most 60 words.

Change type: {!$Input:Version.Change_Type__c}
Changed fields: {!$Input:Version.Changed_Fields__c}
Field-level differences:
{!$Input:Version.Diff_Summary__c}

Say what changed and what the team should do (for example: update the proposal calendar, re-check eligibility).
Use only the differences above. Do not speculate about reasons.
